<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka end-Apr forex reserves down to $1.78 bln.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka end-Apr forex reserves down to $1.78 bln.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's foreign exchange reserves at end-April were down 8.2 percent to $1.78 billion from $1.938 billion at end-December 1996, the Central Bank said in its latest economic report on Friday.</p>
<p>It said there was little change in reserves from March when they were at $1.779 billion.</p>
<p>Comparative figures for April 1996 were not available.</p>
</text>
